   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to requiring\nthe Hudson River Black River Regulation District to undertake a comprehensive\nstudy regarding the beneficiaries of the district and real property tax\napportionments to establish a standard methodology for the determination of\nany future apportionment; to require that certain real property tax costs\nassessed to counties containing lands included in the Hudson River Black River\nRegulating District be paid by the state of New York; and providing for the\nrepeal of such provisions upon expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "A10070",
    "basePrintNoStr": "A10070-2017",
